/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 516 Tm (The original exercise. If possible, return to the same room, chair and position. Remain) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 501 Tm (physically still, but now inhibit thought as far as possible. Haanel acknowledges that) Tj
