1 0 0 1 58 755 Tm (origins backwards: the steel plates and foundries, the ore and mines, the engineers and) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 740 Tm (architects, the plans, the decision to build it and the scientific discovery that made it) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 725 Tm (possible for such a vessel to float. Haanel's example moves from the visible ship back) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 710 Tm (through materials, labour, planning, public decisions and underlying knowledge.) Tj
0.14 0.20 0.28 rg
/F1 10.5 Tf
