1 0 0 1 58 554 Tm (detailed image. Haanel uses the growth of a plant to illustrate the process by which) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 539 Tm (something develops from an unseen beginning into a visible form. In this part he also) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 524 Tm (gives the affirmation "I am whole, perfect, strong, powerful, loving, harmonious and) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 509 Tm (happy." He presents it as an expression of spiritual Truth and claims it will bring) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 494 Tm (harmonious conditions; that is Haanel's metaphysical claim, not a scientifically) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 479 Tm (demonstrated effect of repeating the sentence.) Tj
