/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 456 Tm (The original exercise. Choose a flower you admire. Visualise the seed being planted,) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 441 Tm (watered and placed where it receives the morning sun. Follow the roots as they extend,) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 426 Tm (the stem as it rises, the branches and leaves as they form, and the bud as it opens into) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 411 Tm (the flower. Haanel even asks the student to become conscious of the imagined fragrance.) Tj
0.14 0.20 0.28 rg
/F1 10.5 Tf
