/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 208 Tm (Modern research supports a limited set of connections: attention can be practised;) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 193 Tm (repeated behaviour in a stable context can become more automatic; and learning can change) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 178 Tm (the functioning of neural networks, a broad phenomenon often described as) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 163 Tm (neuroplasticity. Some self-affirmation interventions can have modest effects in certain) Tj
