/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 664 Tm (A 2025 meta-analysis of self-affirmation interventions reported small positive effects) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 649 Tm (across several wellbeing measures. The interventions studied were varied and are not) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 634 Tm (equivalent to repeating Haanel's exact affirmations. These findings should not be used to) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 619 Tm (claim that the Master Key System has been scientifically proven.) Tj
